+# Transport Compression Codec
+
+Nothing is currently recorded for the transport compression codec. The project tracked this decision in `config/decisions/revoke-compression.json` (which held `gzip`, then `zstd`), but that file was deleted in commit `6babe0a` ("move decision config out of the tree") along with the other decision config files, and no replacement record has been added since. Until a new decision is recorded, no compression codec should be assumed or described as current policy.
